In a nutshell&nbsp;

As a Business Analytics Intern at Picnic, you’ll be at the forefront of international innovation, tackling complex challenges with fresh, groundbreaking solutions. This dual-location role is all about driving impact. You'll analyze data, help identify opportunities, and support strategies that redefine the grocery shopping experience across Europe. Throughout this year-long program, you’ll exchange between two locations Paris (6 months) and Amsterdam (6 months) , gaining cross-market perspectives in a fast-paced environment.&nbsp;

Tricks of the trade

• Solving real-life puzzles: Tackle critical business questions that shape Picnic’s business model every day.&nbsp;

• Enabling: Achieve operational excellence by approaching challenges with a data-driven and analytical mindset.

• Building: Create and optimize models for real-time improvements.

• Communicating: Work effectively with different teams to deliver impactful and sustainable solutions.

• Owning your projects : Take initiative by challenging the status-quo. Just because it’s been done that way doesn’t mean it’s the best way. Try us!

